        "title": "Delivery & Shipping Policy",
        "content": "<p>We want to ensure your pet safety gear arrives quickly and safely. This policy outlines our delivery methods, processing times, and shipping terms.</p><h3>1. Order Processing Times</h3><ul><li>All orders are processed, packaged, and dispatched within <strong>1 to 2 business days</strong> (Monday through Friday, excluding public holidays).</li><li>For custom laser-engraved products (such as our Personalized ID Tags), please allow an additional <strong>1 business day</strong> for precision laser production.</li></ul><h3>2. Shipping Methods &amp; Delivery Times</h3><ul><li><strong>Standard Insured Delivery:</strong> Typical transit time takes <strong>3 to 7 business days</strong> within the United States via standard tracked carriers (USPS, DHL eCommerce, or FedEx).</li><li>Real-time tracking details are automatically emailed to you the moment your package is scanned by the carrier, allowing you to follow your delivery from our facility to your doorstep.</li></ul><h3>3. Shipping &amp; Handling Fees</h3><ul><li><strong>Promotional Anniversary Items:</strong> For promotional safety initiative items, product retail prices are waived ($0.00), and a standard flat-rate shipping and handling fee of <strong>$9.95</strong> applies. This fee covers priority warehouse picking, protective shock-proof packaging, transit insurance, and direct carrier tracking.</li><li>All applicable shipping charges are clearly calculated and displayed before you finalize payment.</li></ul><h3>4. Order Tracking &amp; Customer Support</h3><p>If you have any questions about the status of your shipment or need tracking assistance, our customer support team is here to help:</p><ul><li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:support@safepetstrap.com\">support@safepetstrap.com</a></li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href=\"tel:+13073551993\">(307) 355-1993</a></li><li><strong>Hours:</strong> Monday – Friday, 9:00 AM – 5:00 PM EST</li><li><strong>Corporate Address:</strong> OUSI PLAY LLC, 30 N Gould St, Ste R, Sheridan, WY 82801, USA</li></ul>",
